{"id":"claim.alula.location.ar","text":"العُلا\nتقع العلا في شمال غرب المملكة العربية السعودية.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula","language":"ar","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula"}}
{"id":"claim.alula.location.en","text":"AlUla\nAlUla is located in north-west Saudi Arabia.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula","language":"en","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula"}}
{"id":"claim.alula.major-sites.ar","text":"العُلا\nتشمل أبرز مواقع العلا الحجر والبلدة القديمة ودادان وجبل عكمة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula","language":"ar","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula"}}
{"id":"claim.alula.major-sites.en","text":"AlUla\nMajor AlUla sites include Hegra, AlUla Old Town, Dadan, and Jabal Ikmah.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula","language":"en","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula"}}
{"id":"claim.hegra.unesco-first.ar","text":"موقع الحِجر الأثري\nالحجر أول موقع سعودي أُدرج في قائمة التراث العالمي لليونسكو.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hegra","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.hegra","language":"ar","claim_type":"designation","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/a-carved-phenomenon-envisioning-the-past"}}
{"id":"claim.hegra.unesco-first.en","text":"Hegra Archaeological Site\nHegra was the first Saudi property inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hegra","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.hegra","language":"en","claim_type":"designation","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/a-carved-phenomenon-envisioning-the-past"}}
{"id":"claim.alula-old-town.material.ar","text":"البلدة القديمة في العُلا\nتتميز البلدة القديمة في العلا بنسيج من المباني الطينية والممرات المتقاربة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula-old-town","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula-old-town","language":"ar","claim_type":"architecture","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/alula-old-town"}}
{"id":"claim.alula-old-town.material.en","text":"AlUla Old Town\nAlUla Old Town is characterized by a dense fabric of mudbrick buildings and lanes.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.alula-old-town","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.alula-old-town","language":"en","claim_type":"architecture","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/alula-old-town"}}
{"id":"claim.dadan.location.ar","text":"دادان وجبل عِكمة\nيقع موقع دادان وجبل عكمة في محافظة العلا.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.dadan-jabal-ikmah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.dadan-jabal-ikmah","language":"ar","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/jabal-ikmah-in-alula"}}
{"id":"claim.dadan.location.en","text":"Dadan and Jabal Ikmah\nDadan and Jabal Ikmah are located in AlUla.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.dadan-jabal-ikmah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.dadan-jabal-ikmah","language":"en","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/jabal-ikmah-in-alula"}}
{"id":"claim.dadan.inscriptions.ar","text":"دادان وجبل عِكمة\nيشتهر جبل عكمة بمجموعة كبيرة من النقوش القديمة المرتبطة بتاريخ الواحة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.dadan-jabal-ikmah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.dadan-jabal-ikmah","language":"ar","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/jabal-ikmah-in-alula"}}
{"id":"claim.dadan.inscriptions.en","text":"Dadan and Jabal Ikmah\nJabal Ikmah is known for a major collection of ancient inscriptions connected to the oasis's history.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.dadan-jabal-ikmah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.dadan-jabal-ikmah","language":"en","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/alula/attractions/jabal-ikmah-in-alula"}}
{"id":"claim.diriyah.first-state.ar","text":"الدرعية التاريخية\nكانت الدرعية موطن الدولة السعودية الأولى.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.diriyah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.diriyah","language":"ar","claim_type":"history","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/see-do/destinations/diriyah"}}
{"id":"claim.diriyah.first-state.en","text":"Historic Diriyah\nDiriyah was the home of the First Saudi State.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.diriyah","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.diriyah","language":"en","claim_type":"history","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/see-do/destinations/diriyah"}}
{"id":"claim.at-turaif.designation.ar","text":"حي الطريف بالدرعية\nحي الطريف في الدرعية موقع مدرج في قائمة التراث العالمي لليونسكو.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.at-turaif","source_id":"source.unesco.at-turaif","language":"ar","claim_type":"designation","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1329"}}
{"id":"claim.at-turaif.designation.en","text":"At-Turaif District in ad-Dir'iyah\nAt-Turaif District in Diriyah is inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.at-turaif","source_id":"source.unesco.at-turaif","language":"en","claim_type":"designation","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1329"}}
{"id":"claim.bujairi.view.ar","text":"مطل البجيري ووادي حنيفة\nيطل مطل البجيري على حي الطريف عبر وادي حنيفة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.bujairi-terrace","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.bujairi","language":"ar","claim_type":"visitor-context","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/see-do/destinations/diriyah"}}
{"id":"claim.bujairi.view.en","text":"Bujairi Terrace and Wadi Hanifah\nBujairi Terrace overlooks At-Turaif across Wadi Hanifah.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.bujairi-terrace","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.bujairi","language":"en","claim_type":"visitor-context","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/see-do/destinations/diriyah"}}
{"id":"claim.jeddah.gateway.ar","text":"جدة التاريخية\nمثلت جدة التاريخية بوابة للحجاج القادمين بحرًا في طريقهم إلى مكة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.historic-jeddah","source_id":"source.unesco.historic-jeddah","language":"ar","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1361"}}
{"id":"claim.jeddah.gateway.en","text":"Historic Jeddah, the Gate to Makkah\nHistoric Jeddah served as a gateway for pilgrims arriving by sea on their way to Makkah.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.historic-jeddah","source_id":"source.unesco.historic-jeddah","language":"en","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1361"}}
{"id":"claim.nasseef.context.ar","text":"بيت نصيف\nيقع بيت نصيف ضمن النسيج العمراني التاريخي لمنطقة البلد في جدة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.nasseef-house","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.nasseef-house","language":"ar","claim_type":"architecture","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/jeddah"}}
{"id":"claim.nasseef.context.en","text":"Nasseef House\nNasseef House stands within the historic urban fabric of Jeddah's Al-Balad district.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.nasseef-house","source_id":"source.visitsaudi.nasseef-house","language":"en","claim_type":"architecture","source_url":"https://www.visitsaudi.com/ar/jeddah"}}
{"id":"claim.al-ahsa.composition.ar","text":"واحة الأحساء\nتضم واحة الأحساء بساتين وقنوات وعيونًا وآبارًا وبحيرة صرف ومباني تاريخية ومواقع أثرية.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.al-ahsa-oasis","source_id":"source.unesco.al-ahsa","language":"ar","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1563"}}
{"id":"claim.al-ahsa.composition.en","text":"Al-Ahsa Oasis\nAl-Ahsa Oasis comprises gardens, canals, springs, wells, a drainage lake, historic buildings, and archaeological sites.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.al-ahsa-oasis","source_id":"source.unesco.al-ahsa","language":"en","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1563"}}
{"id":"claim.al-ahsa.palms.ar","text":"واحة الأحساء\nتذكر اليونسكو أن واحة الأحساء تضم نحو 2.5 مليون نخلة.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.al-ahsa-oasis","source_id":"source.unesco.al-ahsa","language":"ar","claim_type":"scale","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1563"}}
{"id":"claim.al-ahsa.palms.en","text":"Al-Ahsa Oasis\nUNESCO states that Al-Ahsa Oasis contains about 2.5 million date palms.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.al-ahsa-oasis","source_id":"source.unesco.al-ahsa","language":"en","claim_type":"scale","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1563"}}
{"id":"claim.hima.location.ar","text":"منطقة حِمى الثقافية\nتقع منطقة حمى الثقافية في منطقة جبلية جافة بجنوب غرب المملكة وعلى طريق قوافل قديم.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hima-cultural-area","source_id":"source.unesco.hima","language":"ar","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1619"}}
{"id":"claim.hima.location.en","text":"Hima Cultural Area\nHima Cultural Area lies in an arid mountainous area of south-west Saudi Arabia on an ancient caravan route.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hima-cultural-area","source_id":"source.unesco.hima","language":"en","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1619"}}
{"id":"claim.hima.rock-art.ar","text":"منطقة حِمى الثقافية\nتوثق فنون ونقوش حمى الصخرية استمرارية ثقافية تمتد نحو سبعة آلاف عام.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hima-cultural-area","source_id":"source.unesco.hima","language":"ar","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1619"}}
{"id":"claim.hima.rock-art.en","text":"Hima Cultural Area\nHima's rock art and inscriptions document cultural continuity spanning about 7,000 years.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hima-cultural-area","source_id":"source.unesco.hima","language":"en","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1619"}}
{"id":"claim.hail.components.ar","text":"الفنون الصخرية في منطقة حائل\nيتكون موقع الفنون الصخرية في حائل من جبل أم سنمان في جبة وجبلي المنجور وراط في الشويمس.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hail-rock-art","source_id":"source.unesco.hail-rock-art","language":"ar","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1472"}}
{"id":"claim.hail.components.en","text":"Rock Art in the Hail Region\nThe Hail rock-art property comprises Jabal Umm Sinman at Jubbah and Jabal al-Manjor and Raat at Shuwaymis.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hail-rock-art","source_id":"source.unesco.hail-rock-art","language":"en","claim_type":"composition","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1472"}}
{"id":"claim.hail.timespan.ar","text":"الفنون الصخرية في منطقة حائل\nتعرض نقوش الشويمس تمثيلات بشرية وحيوانية تغطي نحو عشرة آلاف عام من التاريخ.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hail-rock-art","source_id":"source.unesco.hail-rock-art","language":"ar","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1472"}}
{"id":"claim.hail.timespan.en","text":"Rock Art in the Hail Region\nThe Shuwaymis petroglyphs include human and animal representations covering about 10,000 years of history.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.hail-rock-art","source_id":"source.unesco.hail-rock-art","language":"en","claim_type":"significance","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1472"}}
{"id":"claim.uruq.location.ar","text":"عروق بني معارض\nتقع عروق بني معارض عند الحافة الغربية للربع الخالي.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.uruq-bani-maarid","source_id":"source.unesco.uruq-bani-maarid","language":"ar","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1699"}}
{"id":"claim.uruq.location.en","text":"Uruq Bani Ma'arid\nUruq Bani Ma'arid is situated at the western edge of the Empty Quarter.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.uruq-bani-maarid","source_id":"source.unesco.uruq-bani-maarid","language":"en","claim_type":"location","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1699"}}
{"id":"claim.uruq.wildlife.ar","text":"عروق بني معارض\nتتميز المحمية بإعادة توطين أنواع صحراوية بارزة، منها المها العربي وغزال الرمال العربي.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.uruq-bani-maarid","source_id":"source.unesco.uruq-bani-maarid","language":"ar","claim_type":"biodiversity","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1699"}}
{"id":"claim.uruq.wildlife.en","text":"Uruq Bani Ma'arid\nThe property is notable for the reintroduction of iconic desert species including the Arabian oryx and Arabian sand gazelle.","metadata":{"site_id":"place.uruq-bani-maarid","source_id":"source.unesco.uruq-bani-maarid","language":"en","claim_type":"biodiversity","source_url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1699"}}
